eference *</label><input name="transaction_reference" required maxlength="190" placeholder="M-Pesa code or bank transfer reference"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Proof <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="file" name="proof_file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf"><div class="help">JPG, PNG or PDF, max 5 MB. Stored outside the public assets folder.</div></div><div class="field"><label>Internal note <span class="optional">optional</span></label><textarea name="notes" rows="2"></textarea></div><button class="wbtn primary" type="submit">Save payment trace</button></form></details>
